has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 2 player local coop you and a friend can sit back and enjoy a night of wonder as you feast your eyes and ears on hand crafted levels set over many different biomes. By collecting gems, coins and golden statues you can become a trader in one of the 4 big cities, sell high, buy low to amass your fortune and even purchase the restaurant of your dreams. Hire a team and manage the profit by tweaking the menu and layout of your establishment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295490/extras/28d396dea1763b5908ee8cb9be3120aa.avif?t=1748875849\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a distinct 80s platformer feel reminiscent of the Mario games, this is one cartoon extravaganza not to be missed. Thousands of hours have been painstakingly spent hand drawing genuinely adorable 2D art as well as developing interesting game mechanics, power-ups and oodles of secrets. Replay each level to improve your score and time, even competing against your own ghost character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295490/extras/49ded2a5c535db7c9311830d83bf5d02.avif?t=1748875849\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JellyStar always feels alive with its cast of over 50 characters and enemies who each have their own home town and can travel freely between any level they please. Collect the 50 chunks of the JellyStar to rebuild it and bring peace and happiness back to the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\">